<title>DENMARK: Danish Dec wholesale prices up 1.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Danish Dec wholesale prices up 1.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish wholesale prices rose by 0.4 percent in December from November and were up 1.2 percent from December 1995, the national statistics office said on Monday.  </p>
<p>					Dec 1996   Nov 1996   Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Change on month (percent)    +0.4	 -0.3	  +0.3</p>
<p>    Change on year (percent)     +1.2	 +1.1	  +1.8</p>
<p>    Index (base year 1990=100)  104.5	104.1	 103.3</p>
<p>NOTE - The statistics office changed the index base year to 1990 from 1980, effective April 1994.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969652</p>
</text>
